0..70 Comment "// Vector programs as they should read, and what refuses each of them."
71..73 Comment "//"
74..151 Comment "// A case on a vector binds each arm\'s index equation and prunes an arm whose"
152..228 Comment "// ends are apart. It does not refine by the equation. A result typed at the"
229..294 Comment "// scrutinee\'s index is refused where the arm\'s own index stands."
295..297 Comment "//"
298..369 Comment "// The checker refuses each declaration below by the name its attribute"
370..448 Comment "// states. Each turns to `checks` as its rung lands, and the source then moves"
449..470 Comment "// to the model root."
471..473 Comment "//"
474..547 Comment "// - see: #3483 — not implemented: refinement by solution, for `append`"
548..618 Comment "// - see: #3515 — not implemented: injectivity, for `tail` and `zip`"
619..692 Comment "// - see: #3516 — not implemented: an implicit under a constructor, for"
693..711 Comment "//   `firstOfPair`"
712..790 Comment "// - see: #3517 — not implemented: an implicit block on `def rec`, for `zip`"
791..808 Comment "//   and `append`"
809..864 Comment "// - see: #3481 — the spike that wrote these programs"
866..903 Comment "// The naturals the lengths count in."
